# Patterns are matched from the root of the build context, not at any depth as in
# .gitignore, so whatever also exists inside backend/ and frontend/ needs **/.
# Without it a local build copies the host's own node_modules over the dependencies
# just installed from the lockfile.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
*.md
!TOS.md
LICENSE
docker-compose*.yml
branding
.dockerignore
